  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "MMLongBench",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tMMLongBench: Benchmarking Long-Context Vision-Language Models Effectively and Thoroughly\n\t\n\n\n    [Sept 2025] \ud83c\udf89 MMLongBench is accepted as a spotlight at NeurIPS 2025!!!\n\n\n\ud83c\udf10 Homepage | \ud83e\udd17 Dataset | \ud83e\udd17 Paper | \ud83d\udcd6 arXiv | GitHub\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tAbstract\n\t\n\nThe rapid extension of context windows in large vision-language models has given rise to long-context vision-language models (LCVLMs), which are capable of handling hundreds of images with interleaved text tokens in a single forward\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/ZhaoweiWang/MMLongBench.",
